From dbfc5eee79d4046a127f7f9ac385fc9ee3427012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:23:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] feat(web): a jstack home with no live work is one line, which
 unfolds to what it merged lately

The idle line under a child home is gone. A home with nothing live shows its name and its age,
and when jbus merged some of its tasks lately its chevron, its arrow keys and its menu unfold
them, newest first. A home with live work keeps its tally and opens as before.
